<title>MALAYSIA: F&amp;N Holdings 6-mth net 28.40 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>F&amp;N Holdings 6-mth net 28.40 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Mar 31, '97</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  28.40   vs	  10.03</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 16.5    vs	  20.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   558.74   vs	 154.13</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    45.85   vs	  15.03</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  3.34   vs  less   1.58</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 7.0    vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Fraser &amp; Neave Holdings Bhd makes glass containers, soft drinks and dairy products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
